  unitName: Queen Jade (EU)
  unitId: 730145
  unitNumber: 7068
  description: 'Queen Jade, the Beheader of the Cruel Forest and the Crimson Fort,
    is now famous for trying to behead her husband and successfully doing so for
    a lot of young men. Strangely there is less courtiers and followers around her
    now; she has only been able to seduce one into staying: King Jason of the Golden
    Highlands.'
  summonDesc: Hello, I'm a head collector, can I have yours? Do you need it?
  fusionDesc: Can I get ahead? A head?
  evoDesc: Many Men, Many heads. Can you collect some for me? Yes heads, not men...
    I collect it.
